WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.534 --> 00:00:16.716
Riley: Snooks, you lost a tooth!

2
00:00:16.717 --> 00:00:20.090
Ben: I wish I'd lose a tooth.

3
00:00:20.091 --> 00:00:23.425
Snooks: Ar-ooo!

4
00:00:23.426 --> 00:00:32.022
Skyler: Let's put Snooks' tooth on his pillow.

5
00:00:32.023 --> 00:00:34.549
Mrs. Summers: You can put it in this envelope.

6
00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:38.849
Then it won't get lost.

7
00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:42.277
Ben: Let's write a note to the Dog Tooth Fairy.

8
00:00:42.278 --> 00:00:47.444
Skyler: Good idea!

9
00:00:47.445 --> 00:00:51.550
Riley: Here's some paper and a pencil.

10
00:00:51.551 --> 00:00:55.626
Theo: Let's pretend Snooks is writing the note.

11
00:00:55.627 --> 00:01:02.051
Riley: Yeah! Dear Dog Tooth Fairy . . .

12
00:01:02.052 --> 00:01:04.288
Skyler: Here is my tooth.

13
00:01:04.289 --> 00:01:08.052
Please bring me a surprise.

14
00:01:08.053 --> 00:01:13.296
Theo: I have been a good dog. Love, Snooks.

15
00:01:13.297 --> 00:01:21.929
Riley: P.S. I didn't mean to dig up the rosebushes.

16
00:01:21.930 --> 00:01:26.794
Riley: Bye! Don't forget to come to my house tomorrow.

17
00:01:26.795 --> 00:01:30.478
Theo: To see if the Dog Tooth Fairy came!

18
00:01:30.479 --> 00:01:39.906
Riley: And if she left a surprise for Snooks!

19
00:01:39.907 --> 00:01:43.157
The Dog Tooth Fairy came!

20
00:01:43.158 --> 00:01:45.577
Ben: What did she leave for Snooks?

21
00:01:45.578 --> 00:01:48.041
Riley: A doggie treat.

22
00:01:48.042 --> 00:01:55.901
Snooks: Ar-ooo!

23
00:01:55.902 --> 00:01:58.111
Riley: Good dog!

24
00:01:58.112 --> 00:02:05.373
Skyler: Let's go tell Sarah!

25
00:02:05.374 --> 00:02:08.294
Theo: Hi, Sarah!

26
00:02:08.295 --> 00:02:12.147
Riley: What's wrong?

27
00:02:12.148 --> 00:02:14.742
Sarah: I can't find my tooth!

28
00:02:14.743 --> 00:02:16.664
Riley: What?

29
00:02:16.665 --> 00:02:21.029
Sarah: My first tooth came out yesterday.

30
00:02:21.030 --> 00:02:24.997
I was holding it after school.

31
00:02:24.998 --> 00:02:28.348
Ben: Right. You were in a big hurry.

32
00:02:28.349 --> 00:02:31.325
We bumped into each other in the hallway.

33
00:02:31.326 --> 00:02:33.879
Sarah: I had to go to the dentist.

34
00:02:33.880 --> 00:02:36.382
I wanted to show him my tooth.

35
00:02:36.383 --> 00:02:42.128
Sarah: But when I got there, it was gone!
